### hello-post
POST http://localhost:8888/hello/aa
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "aaa": 111,
  "bbb": "b01"
}

### hello-get
GET http://localhost:8888/hello
Accept: application/json

### gw-get
GET http://localhost:8888/gw
Accept: application/json

### gw-hhrpc
POST http://localhost:8888/gw/hhrpc/com.hhrpc.hhrpc.demo.api.UserService
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceName": "com.hhrpc.hhrpc.demo.api.UserService",
  "methodSign": "findById#java.lang.Integer",
  "args": [100]
}

